        card("Self-evaluation", "Recall the objectives and mark Yes or No: extract information from reading and listening passages about general Filipino manners and etiquette; identify and discuss unique ways Filipinos show respect; discuss Filipino manners and etiquette in business, manner of dressing, dining, and gift giving; transcribe and translate phrases and sentences related to them. Features to check: paki and maki as request prefixes. If you answered No, review the section, find a study partner, or tell your academic counselor or team leader."),
